
# ATM Interface

## Description
A console-based ATM simulation developed using Java and Object-Oriented Programming.

## Features
- User ID and PIN authentication
- Maximum three login attempts
- Balance checking
- Cash withdrawal
- Cash deposit
- Money transfer between accounts
- Transaction history

## Technologies Used
- Java
- Object-Oriented Programming
- ArrayList
- HashMap

## How to Run
Compile:
javac Main.java ATM.java Account.java Bank.java Transaction.java

Run:
java Main
